<BaseLayout title="Matthew Ralph — Governed AI Systems & Workflow Architecture" description="Matthew Ralph designs governed AI systems, workflow architecture, and commercial transformation operating models.">
  <section class="hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">Portfolio</p><h1>Matthew Ralph</h1><p class="lead">Business systems and AI transformation operator focused on governed workflows, technical-program direction, and operational systems.</p><p class="hero-actions"><a class="text-link" href="#selected-work">Explore systems <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/matt-rfs/matthew-ralph-work-samples">Public work samples <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></section>
  <section class="commercial-foundation shell" aria-labelledby="commercial-foundation-title"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Commercial foundation</p><h2 id="commercial-foundation-title">Commercial operator first. Systems work built on top.</h2></div><p class="commercial-intro">15+ years across commercial leadership, GTM, enablement, business development, client operations, and business-building inform Matthew’s current work in governed systems and AI transformation.</p><div class="commercial-grid"><article><p class="eyebrow">Enablement / adoption</p><strong>40% conversion improvement</strong><span>Contributed to a broader enablement program that improved conversion by 40% and reduced ramp time by 30%.</span></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Commercial scale</p><strong>$2.5M+ quarterly pipeline</strong><span>Supported $2.5M+ in quarterly pipeline through disciplined commercial process and performance visibility.</span></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Direct execution</p><strong>$2M+ recurring revenue</strong><span>Generated $2M+ in recurring revenue while increasing average deal size by 35%.</span></article><article><p class="eyebrow">Operating leadership</p><strong>56 employees · ~90% retention</strong><span>Co-founded and scaled Right Choice Security to 56 employees while maintaining approximately 90% client retention.</span></article></div></section>
  <section class="shell work-section" aria-labelledby="selected-work"><div class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h2 id="selected-work">Two governed systems for consequential work.</h2></div><div class="project-grid"><ProjectCard title="Job Opportunity Engine" label="AI systems & governance" description="Private, local-first job collection, evaluation, and review-oriented preparation with governed evidence and human authority." href={`${base}/work/job-opportunity-engine/`} /><ProjectCard title="Response Flow Systems" label="Implemented offline governance" description="Outbound approval, evidence custody, message lineage, and fail-closed exception handling for commercial workflows." href={`${base}/work/response-flow-systems/`} /></div><p class="work-samples-note">Looking for architecture and governance documentation? <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/matt-rfs/matthew-ralph-work-samples">Inspect public work samples <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p></section>
</BaseLayout>
